    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRAVIS A. GRESHAM, JR.\nSENATOR 24TH DISTRICT\nP. 0. BOX 1326\n2110 FIRST STREET\nFT. MYERS, FLORIDA\nTHE FLORIDA SENATE\nTALLAHASSEE\nCOMMITTEES:\nMISCELLANEOUS LEGISLATION, CHAIRMAN\nRULES AND CALENDAR, VICE CHAIRMAN\nMEMBER OF:\nAPPROPRIATIONS\nCONSTITUTIONAL AMENDMENTS AND\nGOVERNMENTAL REORGANIZATION\nCOUNTY\nORGANIZATIONS\nGAME AND FISHERIES\nGENERAL LEGISLATION\nJUDICIARY B\nLEGISLATIVE MANAGEMENT AND POPULATION\nCHEC ROAS ANDHIGHYAYS\nTEMPERANCE\nMay 21, 1962\nMx. Harold M. Bixby\nCaptiva, Florida\nDear Mr. Bixby:\nRepesh in gly\nI wanted to acknowledge receipt of your\nletter of April 20, 1962, and your kind check for $25.00,\nenclosed therewith.\nDuring each of my three campaigns,\nit has been my policy not to accept any campaign dona-\ntions from any of my friends and supporters. In carrying\nout that policy I am returning herewith your kind check\nfor $25.00.\nI do want to express my appreciation to you for\nyour offer of support and particularly for your letter\nwhich accompanied it. I hope to continue to give all possi-\nble support to the J. N. \"Ding\" Darling State Park, and also\nto continue conservation interests in our area.\nThank you so much for your interest in taking the\ntime to write to me.\nWith kindest personal regards, I am,\nSincerely yours,\nclam\nTravis A. Gresham, Jr.\nTAG/ jc"
    ],
